## Backtest Period Split

- Development period: 2012-01-01 to 2021-12-31 (10 years)
- Out-of-sample test period: 2022-01-01 to 2024-12-31 (3 years)
- Chosen because: development period captures multiple regimes (2008 financial crash, 2018 selloff,
  2020 COVID crash); out-of-sample period includes the 2022 rate-hiking
  selloff, giving it a genuine stress test rather than only calm markets
- Commitment: strategy parameters will not be modified based on
  out-of-sample results. Any future change requires a new strategy version
  (v1.1+) applied prospectively, not retroactively to this test.
